{"filename":"intake-template.md","source_text":"# Scheduler project intake v1\n\nProject ID: dummy-sample-project\nProject name: Sample project plan\nRepository path: ./runtime/examples/dummy-sample-project\nBase branch: main\nMaximum workers: 2\n\n## Description\nPlan a synthetic sample report. Simulation receipts illustrate task order; they do not create the described report.\n\n## Tasks\n\n### source: Specify sample input\nDescription: Define the sample records and fields for the report.\nEstimate minutes: 3\nDepends on: none\nAcceptance criteria:\n- The sample fields and record count are stated.\n\n### check: Specify quality checks\nDescription: Define checks for missing and out-of-range sample values.\nEstimate minutes: 2\nDepends on: source\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Missing-value and range rules are documented.\n\n### summarize: Specify summary\nDescription: Define how the sample records would be grouped and summarized.\nEstimate minutes: 4\nDepends on: source\nAcceptance criteria:\n- The summary calculation is unambiguous.\n\n### review: Review report outline\nDescription: Combine the quality and summary specifications into a report outline.\nEstimate minutes: 3\nDepends on: check, summarize\nAcceptance criteria:\n- The outline references both preceding specifications.\n","expected_source_sha256":"9a662a81da3220573817ccf5c21c410744cd2c82767fccda9bc159dc5a3dca19","expected_preview":{"project_id":"dummy-sample-project","from_revision":null,"to_revision":1,"added":["check","review","source","summarize"],"removed":[],"modified":[],"requires_approval":false,"risk":"initial-dummy-import"},"approved":true}